          "messageID": "msg_002",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Thanks for sharing it! One thing worth flagging though: once every dependency is mocked, you're not actually testing the integration between those pieces anymore - that makes it a unit test of the route handler's logic in isolation. An integration test for `createTopic` should exercise at least the real database (ideally a test instance) so you're verifying the pieces actually work together."
        },
        {
          "id": "prt_002c",
          "sessionID": "ses_19",
          "messageID": "msg_002",
