          "messageID": "msg_006",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "That test isn't exercising `formatDate` at all - it's asserting that your mock does what you told it to do, which it always will. To actually test the function, call the real `formatDate` with a fixed input date and assert on its real output."
        },
        {
          "id": "prt_006c",
